I, A.B., son of 	resident 	of ………….hereby revoke and cancel all my wills, codicils and other testamentary dispositions heretofore made by me. 
 
IN WITNESS WHEREOF I have hereunto set my hands to this…………. deed, this day of ………….20………….
 
Signed and declared by the above named A.B. to this deed in the  presence of us, who in his presence have hereunto subscribed our  names as witnesses.
 
WITNESSES
1. 
